 └──────────────────────┘

User Browser
     ↓
Local Server
 ├── Flask App (5000)
 └── Express App (3000)

###CI/CD Flow:
GitHub → Jenkins → PM2 → Apps Running

"""Due to AWS access limitation, deployment was simulated locally using PM2 and Jenkins pipeline. 
The architecture remains identical to EC2 deployment."""
